RA_kwDOF-aJgs4laEjB","name":"vendor.tar.gz","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json; charset=utf-8","state":"uploaded","size":19809593,"digest":"sha256:64c7e7af9d7d0680985b899d517ed998f142adffaf4fddcfb0fd8187296d2224","download_count":3,"created_at":"2026-10-10T09:51:24Z","updated_at":"2026-10-10T09:51:26Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/kuaifan/dootask/releases/download/v1.9.66/vendor.tar.gz"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuaifan/dootask/tarball/v1.9.66","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kuaifan/dootask/zipball/v1.9.66","body":"## [1.9.66]\n\n### Features\n\n- 通讯录新增「部门」视图：可在字母视图与部门视图之间切换，按部门树查看成员及人数，展开部门时才加载成员，大团队下打开更快。\n- 周期任务生成新任务时，会自动与原任务建立关联，方便追溯每一次周期任务。\n- 建立或解除任务关联时，会在双方任务的动态中留下记录，关联变化一目了然。\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n- 修复取消任务关联时提示失败（404）的问题，现在可以正常解除关联。\n- 修复个别带批注的 Word 文档导致文件同步中断、后续文件无法被搜索到的问题。\n\n### Security\n\n- 加固通讯录成员搜索，修复按部门筛选时存在的安全隐患。"}